[00:01.94] Someone is waiting
[00:07.50] To swallow all the halos out of you
[00:18.27] As your face blows
[00:21.91] Through my windows
[00:25.57] Sending pieces flying all around the room
[00:37.34] And I love you
[00:40.78] And I want to
[00:44.41] Shoot all the superheroes from your skies
[00:55.34] Watch them bleeding
[00:58.82] From your ceiling
[01:02.71] As their empty anger falls out from their eyes
[01:13.56] All alone...
[01:16.76] 